  "_doc": "Permanent (between-run) progression: the Research tab. Cost for level n+1 = round_to_5(cost_base * cost_growth ^ n). 'unlock_level' is the Player Level needed before it can be bought; 'requires' lists other research as 'id' or 'id:level'. 'kind' says what it is: absent = a levelled stat track with one modifier ('stat' and 'format' say how to show its total); 'unlock' = a one-off that changes how runs play, described by 'desc'; 'doctrine' = only applies while selected, one at a time; 'awakening' = gives 'core' the augment 'augment' from the start of every run.",

